RING SUNSHINE OVER THE TINY FEATURES OF THIS CHILD", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/1221-135766-0006_7176-92135-0040__T2__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-92135-0040__VOICE__1221.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
