ID PAYING THE PRICE OF FATIGUE FOR THE RECREATION PROVIDED FOR THE TOLEDANS IN THEIR VALLEY OR ON THE BANKS OF THEIR RIVER", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/5639-40744-0013_3570-5695-0014__T2__SCV2TTS__3570-3570-5695-0014__VOICE__5639.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
