IN THEIR VALLEY OR ON THE BANKS OF THEIR RIVER", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/5639-40744-0006_672-122797-0026__T2__SCV2TTS__672-672-122797-0026__VOICE__5639.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
