{"key": "8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["1580", "8455"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455.wav"]}, "src": {"1580": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455.wav"], "8455": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455.wav"]}, "target_text": "NO HARM WOULD HAVE BEEN DONE HAD IT NOT BEEN THAT AS HE PASSED YOUR DOOR HE PERCEIVED THE KEY WHICH HAD BEEN LEFT BY THE CARELESSNESS OF YOUR SERVANT", "source_meta": {"key": "8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455", "mixture_id": "8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/1580/141084/1580-141084-0041.flac", "target_spk": "1580", "target_utt": "1580-141084-0041", "target_text": "NO HARM WOULD HAVE BEEN DONE HAD IT NOT BEEN THAT AS HE PASSED YOUR DOOR HE PERCEIVED THE KEY WHICH HAD BEEN LEFT BY THE CARELESSNESS OF YOUR SERVANT", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/8455/210777/8455-210777-0053.flac", "interferer_spk": "8455", "interferer_utt": "8455-210777-0053", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/8455/210777/8455-210777-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "8455-210777-0000", "prompt_text": "I REMAINED THERE ALONE FOR MANY HOURS BUT I MUST ACKNOWLEDGE THAT BEFORE I LEFT THE CHAMBERS I HAD GRADUALLY BROUGHT MYSELF TO LOOK AT THE MATTER IN ANOTHER LIGHT", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/8455-210777-0053_1580-141084-0041__T2__SCV2TTS__1580-1580-141084-0041__VOICE__8455.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001__T1__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-88083-0022__VOICE__908", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["7176", "908"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001__T1__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-88083-0022__VOICE__908.wav"]}, "src": {"7176": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001__T1__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-88083-0022__VOICE__908.wav"], "908": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001__T1__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-88083-0022__VOICE__908.wav"]}, "target_text": "THE HAWK EMBITTERED BY THE LOSS OF HIS FIRST QUARRY HAD BECOME AS DOGGED IN PURSUIT AS A WEASEL NOT TO BE SHAKEN OFF OR EVADED OR DECEIVED", "source_meta": {"key": "7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001__T1__SCV2TTS__7176-7176-88083-0022__VOICE__908", "mixture_id": "7176-88083-0022_908-31957-0001", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/7176/88083/7176-88083-0022.flac", "target_spk": "7176", "target_utt": "7176-88083-0022", "target_text": "THE HAWK EMBITTERED BY THE LOSS OF HIS FIRST QUARRY HAD BECOME AS DOGGED IN PURSUIT AS A WEASEL NOT TO BE SHAKEN OFF OR EVADED OR DECEIVED", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/908/31957/908-31957-0001.flac", "interferer_spk": "908", "interferer_utt": "908-31957-0001", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/908/157963/908-157963-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "908-157963-0000", "prompt_text": "TO FADE AWAY LIKE MORNING BEAUTY FROM HER MORTAL DAY DOWN BY THE RIVER OF ADONA HER SOFT VOICE IS HEARD AND THUS HER GENTLE LAMENTATION FALLS LIKE MORNING DEW", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_