HREATENING TO PATCH EVERYBODY IN HIS DOMINIONS IF THE SAILORMAN WAS NOT RECAPTURED", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4077-13751-0006_8555-292519-0011__T1__SCV2TTS__4077-4077-13751-0006__VOICE__8555.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
