RTS OF THOUGHT TO THE DESIGNERS AND ORNAMENT WORKERS OF THE COURT", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4992-41806-0001_7127-75947-0028__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41806-0001__VOICE__7127.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
