OVIDED FOR THE TOLEDANS IN THEIR VALLEY OR ON THE BANKS OF THEIR RIVER", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/5639-40744-0036_8224-274381-0003__T2__SCV2TTS__8224-8224-274381-0003__VOICE__5639.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
