OICING THE HEART OF OLD TURNER THE GARDENER WHO SINCE POLLY'S FIRST RAPTUROUS ENTRANCE HAD TAKEN HER INTO HIS GOOD GRACES FOR ALL TIME", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4077-13754-0007_237-126133-0004__T1__SCV2TTS__4077-4077-13754-0007__VOICE__237.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
