 SAVAGE IS EVER KNOWN EVEN NOW TO PENETRATE ITS WILD RECESSES", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/8224-274381-0013_1320-122617-0013__T1__SCV2TTS__8224-8224-274381-0013__VOICE__1320.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
