TION AND HAD COST SO MANY EFFORTS OF THOUGHT TO THE DESIGNERS AND ORNAMENT WORKERS OF THE COURT", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/7127-75946-0016_5639-40744-0002__T2__SCV2TTS__5639-5639-40744-0002__VOICE__7127.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
