 GAVE A SPLENDID SUPPER TO WHICH SHE HAD INVITED ALL HER RELATIVES AND IT WAS A GOOD OPPORTUNITY FOR ME TO MAKE THEIR ACQUAINTANCE", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3729-6852-0007_8555-284447-0021__T2__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284447-0021__VOICE__3729.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
