T THE PENALTY FOR FORGING A CHECK", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0038__VOICE__6829.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["6829", "3575"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575.wav"]}, "src": {"6829": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575.wav"], "3575": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575.wav"]}, "target_text": "THEY WERE RECEIVED IN THE LITTLE OFFICE BY A MAN NAMED MARKHAM WHO WAS THE JAILER", "source_meta": {"key": "3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575", "mixture_id": "3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/6829/68769/6829-68769-0009.flac", "target_spk": "6829", "target_utt": "6829-68769-0009", "target_text": "THEY WERE RECEIVED IN THE LITTLE OFFICE BY A MAN NAMED MARKHAM WHO WAS THE JAILER", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3575/170457/3575-170457-0038.flac", "interferer_spk": "3575", "interferer_utt": "3575-170457-0038", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3575/170457/3575-170457-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "3575-170457-0000", "prompt_text": "AND OFTEN HAS MY MOTHER SAID WHILE ON HER LAP I LAID MY HEAD SHE FEARED FOR TIME I WAS NOT MADE BUT FOR ETERNITY", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3575-170457-0038_6829-68769-0009__T2__SCV2TTS__6829-6829-68769-0009__VOICE__3575.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["4992", "2094"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094.wav"]}, "src": {"4992": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094.wav"], "2094": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094.wav"]}, "target_text": "SHE MAKES EFFORT AFTER EFFORT TREMBLING WITH EAGERNESS AND WHEN SHE FAILS TO REPRODUCE WHAT SHE SEES SHE WORKS HERSELF INTO A FRENZY OF GRIEF AND DISAPPOINTMENT", "source_meta": {"key": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094", "mixture_id": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/4992/41797/4992-41797-0013.flac", "target_spk": "4992", "target_utt": "4992-41797-0013", "target_text": "SHE MAKES EFFORT AFTER EFFORT TREMBLING WITH EAGERNESS AND WHEN SHE FAILS TO REPRODUCE WHAT SHE SEES SHE WORKS HERSELF INTO A FRENZY OF GRIEF AND DISAPPOINTMENT", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/2094/142345/2094-142345-0033.flac", "interferer_spk": "2094", "interferer_utt": "2094-142345-0033", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/2094/142345/2094-142345-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "2094-142345-0000", "prompt_text": "IT IS A VERY FINE OLD PLACE OF RED BRICK SOFTENED BY A PALE POWDERY LICHEN WHICH HAS DISPERSED ITSELF WITH HAPPY IRREGULARITY SO AS TO BRING THE RED BRICK INTO TERMS OF FRIENDLY COMPANIONSHIP WITH THE LIMESTONE ORNAMENTS SURROUNDING THE THREE GABLES THE WINDOWS AND THE DOOR PLACE", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__4992-4992-41797-0013__VOICE__2094.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["2094", "4992"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992.wav"]}, "src": {"2094": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992.wav"], "4992": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992.wav"]}, "target_text": "WHEN SHE HAD THAT BAD ILLNESS AND I WAS ONLY ELEVEN YEARS OLD SHE USED TO SAY YOU'LL HAVE A FRIEND ON EARTH IN YOUR AUNT RACHEL IF I'M TAKEN FROM YOU FOR SHE HAS A KIND HEART AND I'M SURE I'VE FOUND IT SO", "source_meta": {"key": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992", "mixture_id": "4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/2094/142345/2094-142345-0033.flac", "target_spk": "2094", "target_utt": "2094-142345-0033", "target_text": "WHEN SHE HAD THAT BAD ILLNESS AND I WAS ONLY ELEVEN YEARS OLD SHE USED TO SAY YOU'LL HAVE A FRIEND ON EARTH IN YOUR AUNT RACHEL IF I'M TAKEN FROM YOU FOR SHE HAS A KIND HEART AND I'M SURE I'VE FOUND IT SO", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/4992/41797/4992-41797-0013.flac", "interferer_spk": "4992", "interferer_utt": "4992-41797-0013", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/4992/23283/4992-23283-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "4992-23283-0000", "prompt_text": "BUT THE MORE FORGETFULNESS HAD THEN PREVAILED THE MORE POWERFUL WAS THE FORCE OF REMEMBRANCE WHEN SHE AWOKE", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4992-41797-0013_2094-142345-0033__T2__SCV2TTS__2094-2094-142345-0033__VOICE__4992.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["1320", "3570"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570.wav"]}, "src": {"1320": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570.wav"], "3570": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570.wav"]}, "target_text": "THE DELAWARE DOG HE SAID LEANING FORWARD AND PEERING THROUGH THE DIM LIGHT TO CATCH THE EXPRESSION OF THE OTHER'S FEATURES IS HE AFRAID", "source_meta": {"key": "1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570", "mixture_id": "1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/1320/122617/1320-122617-0037.flac", "target_spk": "1320", "target_utt": "1320-122617-0037", "target_text": "THE DELAWARE DOG HE SAID LEANING FORWARD AND PEERING THROUGH THE DIM LIGHT TO CATCH THE EXPRESSION OF THE OTHER'S FEATURES IS HE AFRAID", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3570/5695/3570-5695-0009.flac", "interferer_spk": "3570", "interferer_utt": "3570-5695-0009", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3570/5694/3570-5694-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "3570-5694-0000", "prompt_text": "BUT ALREADY AT A POINT IN ECONOMIC EVOLUTION FAR ANTEDATING THE EMERGENCE OF THE LADY SPECIALISED CONSUMPTION OF GOODS AS AN EVIDENCE OF PECUNIARY STRENGTH HAD BEGUN TO WORK OUT IN A MORE OR LESS ELABORATE SYSTEM", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/1320-122617-0037_3570-5695-0009__T1__SCV2TTS__1320-1320-122617-0037__VOICE__3570.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
