OUT THE PENALTY FOR FORGING A CHECK", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/6829-68769-0012_1284-1181-0001__T2__SCV2TTS__1284-1284-1181-0001__VOICE__6829.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
