 AND THUS HER GENTLE LAMENTATION FALLS LIKE MORNING DEW", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3570-5694-0010_908-31957-0012__T1__SCV2TTS__3570-3570-5694-0010__VOICE__908.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
