ILORMAN WAS NOT RECAPTURED", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/237-134500-0018_8555-284447-0005__T1__SCV2TTS__237-237-134500-0018__VOICE__8555.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
