T OF RICH AND THRIVING SETTLEMENTS THOUGH NONE BUT THE HUNTER OR THE SAVAGE IS EVER KNOWN EVEN NOW TO PENETRATE ITS WILD RECESSES", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/1089-134686-0011_1320-122612-0004__T1__SCV2TTS__1089-1089-134686-0011__VOICE__1320.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
