CE HAD TAKEN HER INTO HIS GOOD GRACES FOR ALL TIME", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/260-123288-0025_237-134500-0006__T1__SCV2TTS__260-260-123288-0025__VOICE__237.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
