Y ABOUT THE PENALTY FOR FORGING A CHECK", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/5683-32879-0006_6829-68771-0035__T1__SCV2TTS__5683-5683-32879-0006__VOICE__6829.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
