170457-0000", "prompt_text": "AND OFTEN HAS MY MOTHER SAID WHILE ON HER LAP I LAID MY HEAD SHE FEARED FOR TIME I WAS NOT MADE BUT FOR ETERNITY", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3575-170457-0013_8555-284449-0017__T2__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0017__VOICE__3575.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
