URROUNDING THE THREE GABLES THE WINDOWS AND THE DOOR PLACE", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/2094-142345-0032_5639-40744-0012__T2__SCV2TTS__5639-5639-40744-0012__VOICE__2094.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
