ADY SPECIALISED CONSUMPTION OF GOODS AS AN EVIDENCE OF PECUNIARY STRENGTH HAD BEGUN TO WORK OUT IN A MORE OR LESS ELABORATE SYSTEM", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/6930-75918-0001_3570-5694-0011__T1__SCV2TTS__6930-6930-75918-0001__VOICE__3570.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
