ED WITH REAL ENTHUSIASM", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/1995-1826-0009_7127-75947-0040__T2__SCV2TTS__7127-7127-75947-0040__VOICE__1995.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
