F OLD TURNER THE GARDENER WHO SINCE POLLY'S FIRST RAPTUROUS ENTRANCE HAD TAKEN HER INTO HIS GOOD GRACES FOR ALL TIME", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/1221-135767-0009_237-134500-0033__T1__SCV2TTS__1221-1221-135767-0009__VOICE__237.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
