S FIRST RAPTUROUS ENTRANCE HAD TAKEN HER INTO HIS GOOD GRACES FOR ALL TIME", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3570-5695-0004_237-126133-0015__T1__SCV2TTS__3570-3570-5695-0004__VOICE__237.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
