E DESIGNERS AND ORNAMENT WORKERS OF THE COURT", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/3575-170457-0007_7127-75946-0002__T1__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0007__VOICE__7127.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
