{"key": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["8555", "3575"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575.wav"]}, "src": {"8555": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575.wav"], "3575": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575.wav"]}, "target_text": "SO THEY WERE QUITE WILLING TO OBEY THE ORDERS OF THEIR GIRL QUEEN AND IN A SHORT TIME THE BLASTS OF TRUMPETS AND ROLL OF DRUMS AND CLASHING OF CYMBALS TOLD TROT AND CAP'N BILL THAT THE BLUE BANDS HAD ASSEMBLED BEFORE THE PALACE", "source_meta": {"key": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575", "mixture_id": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/8555/284449/8555-284449-0000.flac", "target_spk": "8555", "target_utt": "8555-284449-0000", "target_text": "SO THEY WERE QUITE WILLING TO OBEY THE ORDERS OF THEIR GIRL QUEEN AND IN A SHORT TIME THE BLASTS OF TRUMPETS AND ROLL OF DRUMS AND CLASHING OF CYMBALS TOLD TROT AND CAP'N BILL THAT THE BLUE BANDS HAD ASSEMBLED BEFORE THE PALACE", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3575/170457/3575-170457-0024.flac", "interferer_spk": "3575", "interferer_utt": "3575-170457-0024", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3575/170457/3575-170457-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "3575-170457-0000", "prompt_text": "AND OFTEN HAS MY MOTHER SAID WHILE ON HER LAP I LAID MY HEAD SHE FEARED FOR TIME I WAS NOT MADE BUT FOR ETERNITY", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T1__SCV2TTS__8555-8555-284449-0000__VOICE__3575.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
{"key": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T2__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0024__VOICE__8555", "condition": "similar_content_v2_tts", "spk": ["3575", "8555"], "mix": {"default": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/mix_clean/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T2__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0024__VOICE__8555.wav"]}, "src": {"3575": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s1/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T2__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0024__VOICE__8555.wav"], "8555": ["/data/tse_cue_project/datasets/Libri2Mix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/wav16k/min/test/s2/8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T2__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0024__VOICE__8555.wav"]}, "target_text": "I DON'T ALWAYS SUCCEED FOR SOMETIMES WHEN I'M TEACHING OR SEWING I WOULD RATHER BE READING OR WRITING BUT I TRY TO DENY MYSELF AND MY FATHER'S APPROBATION AMPLY REWARDED ME FOR THE PRIVATION", "source_meta": {"key": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024__T2__SCV2TTS__3575-3575-170457-0024__VOICE__8555", "mixture_id": "8555-284449-0000_3575-170457-0024", "target_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/3575/170457/3575-170457-0024.flac", "target_spk": "3575", "target_utt": "3575-170457-0024", "target_text": "I DON'T ALWAYS SUCCEED FOR SOMETIMES WHEN I'M TEACHING OR SEWING I WOULD RATHER BE READING OR WRITING BUT I TRY TO DENY MYSELF AND MY FATHER'S APPROBATION AMPLY REWARDED ME FOR THE PRIVATION", "original_interferer_source": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/8555/284449/8555-284449-0000.flac", "interferer_spk": "8555", "interferer_utt": "8555-284449-0000", "prompt_audio": "/data/tse_cue_project/imported_data/LibriSpeech960/test-clean/8555/284447/8555-284447-0000.flac", "prompt_utt": "8555-284447-0000", "prompt_text": "THEN HE RUSHED DOWN STAIRS INTO THE COURTYARD SHOUTING LOUDLY FOR HIS SOLDIERS AND THREATENING TO PATCH EVERYBODY IN HIS DOM