HE THREE GABLES THE WINDOWS AND THE DOOR PLACE", "synthetic_interferer": "/data/tse_cue_project/manifests/librimix_similar_content_v2_tts/clean/test/synthetic_interferer/4970-29095-0033_2094-142345-0058__T1__SCV2TTS__4970-4970-29095-0033__VOICE__2094.wav"}, "sir_db": 0.0}
